# fixture_repo — Deliberately Failing Test Suite
#
# This tiny project exists solely to give the sandbox runner's integration
# tests a reproducible "failing pytest run" to capture.
#
# Structure:
#   fixture_repo/
#     setup.cfg          ← makes this an installable package (optional but tidy)
#     tests/
#       test_always_fails.py   ← one test that always fails
#       test_always_passes.py  ← one test that always passes
#
# When mounted into a python:3.11-slim container and executed as:
#   pip install pytest -q && pytest tests/ -v
#
# The expected outcome is:
#   exit_code = 1  (pytest returns non-zero when at least one test fails)
#   "FAILED" appears in stdout
#   "test_always_fails" appears in stdout
